y a wire=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A =
                                               &lt;p&gt;If your printer connects =
by a wire,=0A                                                    plug it in=
to your device. It&#039;ll connect automatically, your=0A                       =
                             PC will download the right drivers, and you ca=
n use it right=0A                                                    away.&lt;=
/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;strong&gt;=0A =
                                                   2. To connect a wireless=
 printer, download the latest=0A                                           =
         driver and software package for your printer model from=0A        =
                                            the official website and follow=
 these steps:=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=
=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;a) Select the S=
tart button, then select Settings &gt;=0A                                     =
               Devices &gt; Printers &amp; scanners &gt; Add a printer or=0A         =
                                           scanner.&lt;/p&gt;=0A                 =
                               &lt;p&gt;b) Wait for it to find nearby printers, t=
hen choose the=0A                                                    one yo=
u want to use, and select Add device. If you want=0A                       =
                             to remove the printer later, just highlight it=
 and=0A                                                    select Remove.&lt;/=
p&gt;=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;h3 cla=
ss=3D&quot;my-4&quot;&gt;Setup a New Printer (Mac)&lt;/h3&gt;=0A=0A                           =
                     &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                           =
         1.Prepare your printer:=0A                                        =
        &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;U=
se the instructions that came with your printer to=0A                      =
                              unpack the printer, install ink or toner, and=
 add paper.=0A                                                    Turn on t=
he printer and make sure it=E2=80=99s not displaying=0A                    =
                                any errors.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                      =
                          &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                      =
              2. Connect your printer: Follow the instructions that=0A     =
                                               came with the printer to con=
nect it to the network.=0A                                                &lt;=
/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt;=0A       =
                                             If you have a Wi-Fi printer, y=
ou might need to connect=0A                                                =
    the printer to your Mac with a USB cable to set up Wi-Fi=0A            =
                                        printing. After connecting the prin=
ter to your Mac,=0A                                                    inst=
all the Mac software that came with the printer and=0A                     =
                               use the printer=E2=80=99s setup assistant to=
 connect the printer=0A                                                    =
to your Wi-Fi network. After setting up, you can=0A                        =
                            disconnect the cable from your printer and Mac =
and the=0A                                                    printer shoul=
d remain connected to the Wi-Fi network.=0A                                =
                &lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A                                                &lt;=
strong&gt;=0A                                                    3. Add the pr=
inter to your list of available printers:=0A                               =
                 &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                                           =
     &lt;p&gt;=0A                                                    Choose Apple=
 menu &gt; System Settings, then click Printers=0A                            =
                        &amp; Scanners in the sidebar. (You may need to scroll=
=0A                                                    down.)&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A    =
                                            &lt;strong&gt;=0A                    =
                                4. When your printer appears in the list, s=
elect your=0A                                                    printer, t=
hen click Add.=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=
=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt; It may take a =
minute or two for your printer to appear.=0A                               =
                     If you see a message prompting you to download new=0A =
                                                   software, make sure to d=
ownload and install it.&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A=0A                                       =
         &lt;strong&gt;=0A                                                    5. =
If you do not see your printer listed on the left,=0A                      =
                              click the Add Printer, Scanner or Fax button =
on the=0A                                                    right.=0A     =
                                           &lt;/strong&gt;=0A=0A                 =
                               &lt;p&gt;=0A                                      =
              A dialogue appears listing printers on your local network.&lt;/p=
