l=0A                                                    down.)&lt;/p&gt;=0A=0A   =
                                             &lt;strong&gt;=0A                   =
                                 4. When your printer appears in the list, =
select your=0A                                                    printer, =
then click Add.=0A                                                &lt;/strong&gt;=
=0A=0A=0A                                                &lt;p&gt; It may take a =
minute or two for your printer to appear.=0A                               =
                     If you see a message prompting you to download new=0A =
